[TEST] Physical examination:  
- Lung auscultation (noting presence/absence of crackles, wheezes, rhonchi, or diminished breath sounds);  
- Inspection for digital clubbing, cyanosis, or supraclavicular/cervical lymphadenopathy;  
- Cardiac auscultation (for S3, murmurs, or elevated JVP).

